Package: TestCQS
Title: Tools for testing commutative quadratic subspace covariance structures
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
  c(
    person("Mateusz", "John", , "mateusz.john@put.poznan.pl", role = c("aut")),
    person("Daniel", "Klein", , "daniel.klein@upjs.sk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: This package provides tools to test whether a scale/covariance matrix has a structure belonging
	to the commutative quadratic subspace (CQS) under multivariate or, more generally, elliptically
	contoured models. The main function, runTestCQS, performs likelihood ratio and Rao score tests of
	the hypothesis that the scale/covariance matrix belongs to a specified CQS structure. Additional functions construct orthogonal basis matrices for
    common CQS covariance structures.
